0 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543310 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543310 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186543092 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543310 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "205ef3eb-ccfc-5714-a196-5890ad4baa93" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542682 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542849 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542921 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542954 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186543146 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186543146 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543324 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "358c69cd-3ebc-5d97-9a9d-cdbfb1e80a78" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542776 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542845 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186542976 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186543110 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186543204 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186542845 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543340 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "515fa882-da2b-53bc-a0ac-98c42e8cebf3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186543340 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1069 "q-66446" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1071 "If $f(x)={x}^{2}+2x-5$, then $f(2p-1)=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e5a43bfc-062d-59bd-8636-9805b214ca53" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543575 #edb/ref 1074 "To find $f(2p-1),$ we write down the function $f$ and replace every occurrence of $x$ with $(2p-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ={x}^{2}+2x-5 \\\\ f(2p-1) & =(2p-1)^{2}+2(2p-1)-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we simplify as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(2p-1) & =(2p-1)^{2}+2(2p-1)-5 \\\\  & =(2p-1)(2p-1)+4p-2-5 \\\\  & =4{p}^{2}-2p-2p+1+4p-7 \\\\  & =4{p}^{2}-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(2p-1)=4{p}^{2}-6.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186543310 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1069 "q-222425" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1071 "If $f(x)=2{x}^{2}-1,$ then $(f∘f)(x)=${{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e71385aa-2fca-5283-a0e8-74b07850b796" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543578 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we note that $(f∘f)(x)$ is equivalent to $f(f(x)).$\n\nTo find $f(f(x)),$ we write down the function $f$ and replace every occurrence of $x$ with $f(x):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =2{x}^{2}-1 \\\\ f(f(x)) & =2(f(x))^{2}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $f(x)=2{x}^{2}-1$ into the right-hand side of the above and simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(f(x)) & =2(f(x))^{2}-1 \\\\  & =2(2{x}^{2}-1)^{2}-1 \\\\  & =2(4{x}^{4}-4{x}^{2}+1)-1 \\\\  & =8{x}^{4}-8{x}^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $(f∘f)(x)=8{x}^{4}-8{x}^{2}+1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186543324 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1069 "q-3900" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1071 "Evaluate $f(x)={x}^{2}-6x+9$ at $x=a+2.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "efcb8d92-e0fd-53fd-9869-69a86351884a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543586 #edb/ref 1074 "To find $f(a+2),$ we write down the function $f$ and replace every occurrence of $x$ with $(a+2):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ={x}^{2}-6x+9 \\\\ f(a+2) & =(a+2)^{2}-6(a+2)+9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we simplify as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(a+2) & =(a+2)^{2}-6(a+2)+9 \\\\  & =(a+2)(a+2)-6a-12+9 \\\\  & ={a}^{2}+2a+2a+4-6a-3 \\\\  & ={a}^{2}-2a+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(a+2)={a}^{2}-2a+1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543600 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186543653 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543600 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0f6227d1-426e-593d-88db-a2fa0e5e0738" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543600 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186543575 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543609 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186543600 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543609 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1fa886ed-c413-5138-87d7-64f1b6254029" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543609 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186543586 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543653 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a94f4e57-f0e0-5cad-b2db-64e85028ec05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186543653 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186543578 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
